Project authors: Zijia Wang; Christofer Toumazou
Project: Exact Range-Count Envelopes Over Ordered Time Series Under
Total-Variation Drift Budgets (LocalWindows)

The native solver is adapted from the authors' C++ research implementation of
LocalWindows and its exact baselines. The portable Python implementation
follows those algorithms and the accompanying paper. See docs/provenance.md
for the source identity and adaptation scope.

