The browser demo includes a 96-reading extract from Cho, Kim, Bent, and Dunn,
BIG IDEAs Lab Glycemic Variability and Wearable Device Data v1.1.3,
PhysioNet, DOI 10.13026/aw6y-fc44, under the Open Data Commons Attribution
License (ODC-By). Attribution, selected source rows, and transformations are
recorded in docs/demos/big001-input.json and docs/demos/README.md. This data
license is separate from the code permissions above. The manuscript is
included as docs/assets/paper.pdf. The full source patient CSV, fonts, and
benchmark logs are not bundled.
